  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-22T07:12:50.331Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the Grabbing feature present in the PhysBones, we can grab hair, tails, ears and much more. But currently when exceed the grabbing/stretch limit you will act like a Jedi, controlling the target bone by distance. It would be amazing a option to drag the player around when you exceed this limit, is a good use for leashes for example! (ofc that will be a boolean option in physbone settings)\n\nAnd we can have a option to add this interaction in other parts like head or chest, to finally be able to pickup players/avatars (some interaction script or idk)\n\nAnd a new option to choose who can move you around (Everyone, Friends, Nobody/Authorized people)",
